pybot-rs
=========

This repository contains a Rust translation of PyBot
(https://github.com/huggingface/pybot), copyright its authors
(Hugging Face), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The generated module crates under crates/gen_*/ adapt the upstream
Python modules, reply pools and matching patterns. The Rust runtime,
translation tooling and compatibility library are modifications made
for this port. The upstream LICENSE is retained in this repository.

The source revision used for this translation is
7d63c7fbebb44c7e466e5c8b5c1f341ab767929e.

The full source corpus is represented, but behavioral equivalence is
not established. See verification/STATUS.md for tested coverage and
known differences. This port is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Hugging Face.
